ould set up a busy network of pollination to keep your flowers in tip-top shape!\n\nWell, what are you waiting for - the bees need you!", "short_description": "Command a swarm of cute bees as they grow & defend flowers against an army of hungry bugs.\nYou control the Queen, buzzing near bees to select them, drawing zig-zag lines through the air for the bees to follow. Help the meadow bloom by bringing pollen to flowers, making new bees, and always - protecting the hive from the evil, nosy Lord Mothmer and his bug minions!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://neomajika.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Neomajika Games", "support_website_url": "https://neomajika.com/support/", "website_url": "https://neomajika.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SIMULATION", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "899672407413233"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "543518261339589"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "643184704278445"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "669826550657482"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3811518062219191"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "643184704278445"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1726765200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "543518261339589"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "Andro